[31m+   <button type="button" class="state-shortcut refusal-help-toggle" id="status-refusal-help" data-kind="view" data-action="refusal-help" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="refusal-legend">Refusal help</button><section class="refusal-legend-panel" id="refusal-legend" aria-labelledby="refusal-legend-title" hidden><h2 id="refusal-legend-title">Refusals on this surface</h2><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-OPEN_PATH_KIDS_REFUSED"><code>OPEN_PATH_KIDS_REFUSED</code> @sceneaxi/profile-kids is refuse-only: no open path, no UI, no commerce.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_KIDS_ASSISTANT_DENIED"><code>DESKTOP_KIDS_ASSISTANT_DENIED</code> Kids denies third-party model routes by default. Nothing crosses over from Game or Website.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_NO_PRESENTATION_RUNTIME"><code>DESKTOP_NO_PRESENTATION_RUNTIME</code> No presentation runtime is mounted on this surface, so the viewport draws no pixels.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_NO_KERNEL_SESSION"><code>DESKTOP_NO_KERNEL_SESSION</code> Without a packaged-host Play response, this shell has no kernel session to report.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_NO_DOCUMENT_BOUND"><code>DESKTOP_NO_DOCUMENT_BOUND</code> This control has no bound authoring operation, so it writes nothing.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-EDITOR_COMMAND_ACTIVE_JOB_MISMATCH"><code>EDITOR_COMMAND_ACTIVE_JOB_MISMATCH</code> Cancel requires the exact active command job returned by the registered start operation.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_UNDO_UNAVAILABLE"><code>DESKTOP_UNDO_UNAVAILABLE</code> Undo becomes available when the active project authoring journal reports a completed Save.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_REDO_UNAVAILABLE"><code>DESKTOP_REDO_UNAVAILABLE</code> Redo becomes available after Undo and remains available until a new mutation commits.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_WINDOW_BELOW_MINIMUM"><code>DESKTOP_WINDOW_BELOW_MINIMUM</code> The editor chrome refuses below its minimum window size rather than rendering an unusable layout.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_ASSISTANT_HOSTED_METERING_UNAVAILABLE"><code>DESKTOP_ASSISTANT_HOSTED_METERING_UNAVAILABLE</code> Hosted assistant metering is unavailable in this desktop tier; choose Local or BYOK.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_OPERATION_NOT_PERMITTED"><code>DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_OPERATION_NOT_PERMITTED</code> Project-browser rename and delete are not permitted by the current project lifecycle contract.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_WEB_CAPABILITY_REQUIRED"><code>DESKTOP_WEB_CAPABILITY_REQUIRED</code> HTML, site-canvas, and asset-injection authoring are available only on the Web Experience profile.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_WEB_ASSET_PATH_INVALID"><code>DESKTOP_WEB_ASSET_PATH_INVALID</code> Injected assets must stay within the bounded normalized project-relative assets/ subset.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_WEB_HTML_INVALID"><code>DESKTOP_WEB_HTML_INVALID</code> Stored HTML must be at most 100,000 characters and contain no null byte.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_DOCUMENT_DATA_INVALID"><code>DESKTOP_DOCUMENT_DATA_INVALID</code> The open Scene Document data is not the JSON object data this loop can edit.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_RUNTIME_UNAVAILABLE"><code>DESKTOP_RUNTIME_UNAVAILABLE</code> No packaged desktop host is attached, so this surface opens, saves, and plays nothing.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_RUNTIME_REQUEST_FAILED"><code>DESKTOP_RUNTIME_REQUEST_FAILED</code> The packaged host threw instead of answering, so no project state changed here.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_RUNTIME_REQUEST_REFUSED"><code>DESKTOP_RUNTIME_REQUEST_REFUSED</code> The packaged host refused the request by name; its own reason is shown beside this one.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_VIEWPORT_UNAVAILABLE"><code>DESKTOP_VIEWPORT_UNAVAILABLE</code> The orchestrated playback completed, but no live viewport acknowledged the synchronized frame.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_AUTHORING_REFUSED"><code>DESKTOP_AUTHORING_REFUSED</code> The shared authoring session refused the edit; its first diagnostic is shown beside this one.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROPOSAL_NOT_REVIEWING"><code>DESKTOP_PROPOSAL_NOT_REVIEWING</code> The host did not park the edit for review, so nothing is staged to save.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROPOSAL_NOT_DISCARDED"><code>DESKTOP_PROPOSAL_NOT_DISCARDED</code> A staged proposal is still held by the host, so re-opening would abandon an edit the host still has.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_EXPORT_PROJECT_REQUIRED"><code>DESKTOP_EXPORT_PROJECT_REQUIRED</code> Choose New Project, Open Project, or a validated recent project before exporting.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_WEB_EXPORT_PROJECT_DIRTY"><code>DESKTOP_WEB_EXPORT_PROJECT_DIRTY</code> Web export requires saved project bytes; save or discard the staged proposal and resolve recovery first.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROFILE_SWITCH_DIRTY"><code>DESKTOP_PROFILE_SWITCH_DIRTY</code> One proposal is already staged; save it or re-open the project to discard it before staging another edit, changing the project, or switching profiles.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_DIRTY"><code>DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_DIRTY</code> Opening a project-browser file refuses while Change Review or recovery is active.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_FILE_MISSING"><code>DESKTOP_PROJECT_BROWSER_FILE_MISSING</code> The saved browser selection is no longer the active document or an admitted manifest asset.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_UNDO_STAGED_PROPOSAL"><code>DESKTOP_UNDO_STAGED_PROPOSAL</code> Undo restores the last completed Save and the host drops the staged proposal with it, so save that proposal or re-open the project to discard it first.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_APPLY_NOT_COMPLETED"><code>DESKTOP_APPLY_NOT_COMPLETED</code> The host did not report the apply as completed, so the staged edit is still pending.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_RECOVERY_PENDING"><code>DESKTOP_RECOVERY_PENDING</code> Durable apply recovery is still pending; save to refresh it or open to re-read in a fresh session before Undo, staging another edit, changing the project, or switching profiles.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_OPEN_PATH_EVIDENCE_INVALID"><code>DESKTOP_OPEN_PATH_EVIDENCE_INVALID</code> The play response carried no closed session with observed tick digests, so nothing is reported as played.</p><p class="refusal-row" id="refusal-DESKTOP_PRODUCT_REQUEST_IN_FLIGHT"><code>DESKTOP_PRODUCT_REQUEST_IN_FLIGHT</code> Another project request is still open; the host holds one session and one proposal, so this control waits rather than racing it.</p></section>[39m
